msgid ""
"If \"Reservation status\" is set to \"Make a tentative reservation\", it is "
"received as a tentative reservation."
msgstr ""
"「予約ステータス」が「仮予約にする」の場合は、仮予約として受け付けます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1920
msgid ""
"The cancellation deadline follows the \"Reservation cancellation\" setting."
msgstr "キャンセルの期限は「予約キャンセル」の設定に従います。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1927
