#: src/bookings/class-booking-admin.php:1497
#: src/bookings/class-booking-admin.php:1773
msgid "Reservation status"
msgstr "予約ステータス"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1935
msgid "Instant confirmation"
msgstr "即時確定"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1938
msgid "Make a tentative reservation"
msgstr "仮予約にする"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1942
msgid ""
"With tentative reservations, reservations are received as \"Tentative\". "
"Change the status to \"Confirmed\" in the reservation list to confirm them."
msgstr ""
"仮予約にすると、予約は「仮予約」で届きます。予約一覧でステータスを「確定」に"
"変更すると確定になります。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1943
msgid ""
"For tentative reservations, a reservation confirmation email will be sent to "
"the user even when the reservation is changed to confirmed."
msgstr ""
"仮予約の場合、確定に変更された時点でもユーザーに予約確定メールが送信されま"
"す。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1944
msgid ""
"*Reservations made by users with administrator privileges and salon "
"privileges will be confirmed immediately."
msgstr ""
"※ 管理者権限及びサロン側の権限を持つユーザーによる予約の場合は即時確定になり"
"ます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1952
msgid "Guidance text for tentative reservation completion"
msgstr "仮予約完了時の案内文"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1961
msgid ""
"This text is displayed below the heading \"Your tentative reservation has "
"been received.\" on the screen shown after a tentative reservation is "
"completed."
msgstr ""
"仮予約が完了した画面で、見出し「仮予約を受け付けました」の下に表示する文章で"
"す。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1962
msgid ""
"You can rewrite it to match how your store operates, such as when you will "
"confirm the reservation (for example, \"We will contact you within 24 hours."
"\") and how you will contact the customer."
msgstr ""
"予約を確定するまでの目安（例: 24時間以内にご連絡します）や連絡方法など、お店"
"の運用に合わせて書き換えられます。"

