"Staff nomination and multiple staff registration are available in the Pro "
"edition."
msgstr "スタッフ指名機能と複数スタッフの登録はPro版で利用できます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2399
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2401
